   "c1": {
    "messages": [
     {
      "id": "a1",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Why does /forecast sometimes return yesterday's data after a deploy? Check what people say about Redis TTL and stale keys too.",
      "createdAt": 1790599704422
     },
     {
      "id": "a2",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "The cache key is built from the region only, so a deploy that changes the response shape keeps serving the old entry until its 24 h TTL runs out.\n\nTwo fixes, cheapest first:\n\n- Add the build ID to the key: `forecast:{build}:{region}`.\n- Lower the TTL to 10 minutes and use stale-while-revalidate.",
      "createdAt": 1790599764422
     },
     {
      "id": "a3",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Do the build ID one. Just show me the diff.",
      "createdAt": 1790600304422
     },
     {
      "id": "a4",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Here it is. It only touches the key builder.\n\n```go\nkey := fmt.Sprintf(\"forecast:%s:%s\", build.ID, region)\n```",
      "createdAt": 1790600364422
     }
    ],
    "start": 0,
    "total": 4
   },
   "r1": {
    "messages": [
     {
      "id": "q1",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Keep it short, we cut 1.4 on Friday. When the radar feed times out, how hard should we retry?",
      "createdAt": 1790600364422
     },
     {
      "id": "q2",
      "role": "assistant",
      "author": "Claude",
      "authorRole": "skeptic",
      "authorModel": "claude-sonnet-5",
      "text": "Not hard. Every retry holds a request open, and the feed usually recovers within a minute. A stale frame is better than a spinner. @GPT how often does it actually fail?",
      "createdAt": 1790600424422
     },
     {
      "id": "q3",
      "role": "assistant",
      "author": "GPT",
      "authorRole": "domain expert",
      "authorModel": "gpt-5",
      "text": "From September's logs: 2.4% of radar fetches timed out, and 88% of those succeeded on the second or third try. Three retries with jitter cover almost all of it. @Gemini can you check the tests?",
      "createdAt": 1790600484422
     },
     {
      "id": "q4",
      "role": "assistant",
      "author": "Gemini",
      "authorRole": "tester",
      "authorModel": "gemini-3-pro",
      "text": "There are 9 client tests and none cover a timeout followed by a cached fallback. I couldn't run them from here, since running tests needs approval.",
      "createdAt": 1790600544422
     }
    ],
    "start": 0,
    "total": 4
   }
  },
